  "items": [
    {
      "_id": "adbd030d2808d9aa",
      "name": "GM Reference: Quill Scratch — Voice & Shop",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>Quillibus “Quill” Scratch</h2>\n<p><strong>Shop:</strong> <em>Scratch &amp; Son Rune, Ward and Inscription</em>.</p>\n<p>There is no son. There has never been a son. Quill says it sounds established.</p>\n<p><strong>Appearance:</strong> A skeletal runecrafter whose own bones contain tiny inscriptions. Several are crossed out. One femur reads LEFT. It is the right femur.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Stellan:</strong> That's your right leg.</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> Yes.</p>\n<p><strong>Stellan:</strong> Why does it say left?</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> Apprenticeship.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>Voice:</strong> Fussy craftsman, magical grammarian, and man who believes incorrect punctuation is a health hazard because for him it sometimes is.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
