    {
      "_id": "6a48f0e8dbeacd49",
      "name": "GM Reference: Quill's First Lesson",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>The Lunch Box</h2>\n<p>Quill places a wooden box on the counter and tells Stellan to open it.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> Open it.</p>\n<p><strong>Stellan:</strong> It's warded.</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> Excellent.</p>\n<p><strong>Stellan:</strong> Against opening?</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> No.</p>\n<p><strong>Stellan:</strong> Against what?</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> That's the lesson.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>The inscription is effectively: <strong>WHEN OPENED BY A PERSON OTHER THAN QUILL → PRODUCE A LOUD NOISE</strong>. The exercise is to identify subject, trigger, scope, result, and anchor rather than reducing the ward to “do not open.”</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
          "custom": "Varrenmoor DM Guide — Ossuary Exchange Vendors",
          "book": "",
          "page": "",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
