    {
      "_id": "c7e2a6d717669bbc",
      "name": "Merchant Reference: Quill's Counter",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>Common Stock</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>blank rune tiles, bone slips, paper charms, carving wax, chalk, and fine chisels,</li>\n<li>anchor nails and thread for temporary inscriptions,</li>\n<li>copying services for non-secret known glyphs,</li>\n<li>inspection of damaged wards and contracts for repair work,</li>\n<li>lessons in inscription grammar.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>He will not sell an unknown glyph as though knowledge of its name were sufficient. The buyer must actually study it.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
