    {
      "_id": "8969594a58579dc8",
      "name": "GM Reference: Lil' Apostrophe at Quill's",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>If Calvin Visits Quill Later</h2>\n<p>Calvin thinks he has found a fellow word wizard. Quill experiences this as a personal attack on grammar.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Lil' Apostrophe:</strong> Yo, bone wizard.</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> Runecrafter.</p>\n<p><strong>Lil' Apostrophe:</strong> Right. Bone words.</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> No.</p>\n<p><strong>Lil' Apostrophe</strong> <em>(pointing at the writing on Quill's forearm)</em>: I mean... from here?</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> A rune is an instruction. Every mark must mean exactly one thing.</p>\n<p><strong>Lil' Apostrophe:</strong> One thing? Every time?</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> Yes.</p>\n<p><strong>Lil' Apostrophe:</strong> Man. That sounds peaceful.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Quill notices Calvin is holding a stick of labeled workshop chalk.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> Put down my chalk.</p>\n<p><strong>Lil' Apostrophe</strong> <em>(reading the label)</em>: Oh. I thought “Quill” was the color.</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> Quill is my name.</p>\n<p><strong>Lil' Apostrophe:</strong> That makes more sense. I was like, what color even is this?</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> Put it down.</p>\n<p><strong>Lil' Apostrophe:</strong> Want me to make you another one?</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> No.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Calvin traces <strong>COPY</strong> on a blank wax tablet. Every written mark in the shop doubles. Duplicate runes crawl onto spare tiles, labels split across jars, extra inscriptions spread along Quill's arm, and copied chalk begins appearing between Calvin's fingers.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Lil' Apostrophe:</strong> Oh, man. Your arm has subtitles now.</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> Put. Down. The chalk.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Calvin opens his hand. Dozens of copied chalk sticks clatter onto the floor.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Lil' Apostrophe:</strong> I only picked up one.</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> Stellan may stay. You may leave.</p>\n<p><strong>Lil' Apostrophe</strong> <em>(to Stellan)</em>: See? That's basically enrollment.</p>\n<p><strong>Quill:</strong> It is not.</p>\n<p><strong>Lil' Apostrophe:</strong> Yeah, but he said it exact.</p>\n</blockquote>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
          "custom": "Varrenmoor DM Guide — Ossuary Exchange Vendors",
